earch directions"},{"type":"p","text":"If pursuing long-term research:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Smart infrastructure"},{"text":"Structural health monitoring"},{"text":"AI-based infrastructure inspection"},{"text":"Transportation optimisation"},{"text":"Railway infrastructure"},{"text":"Bridge engineering"},{"text":"Earthquake engineering"},{"text":"Geotechnical engineering"},{"text":"Sustainable construction"},{"text":"Construction automation"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"Infrastructure asset management"},{"text":"Climate-resilient infrastructure"},{"text":"Smart cities"},{"text":"Pavement engineering"},{"text":"Water-resource management"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"Government civil engineering is moving from conventional construction management toward digital infrastructure management."},{"type":"p","text":"The future engineer may work with:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Survey/GIS","BIM","Digital Twin","Construction Data","Sensors","AI Inspection","Predictive Maintenance"]},{"type":"p","text":"Important future skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Drone-based surveying"},{"text":"LiDAR"},{"text":"AI-based defect detection"},{"text":"Structural health monitoring"},{"text":"Infrastructure asset management"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Sustainable construction"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, these should complement—not replace—strong fundamentals in structures, soil, transportation, construction, surveying and public-works practice."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"flow","items":["Civil core","Structural Engineering","Geotechnical","Transportation","Surveying","Fluid/Water Systems"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Government engineering","Estimation","Rate Analysis","Contracts","Quality Control","Public Works Procedures"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Tools","AutoCAD","Civil 3D","STAAD/ETABS",